WEBVTT

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:34.780
Matsutake mushroom rice
 and steamed matsutake mushrooms.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.760
Grilled matsutake mushrooms 
and matsutake mushroom tempura.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.400
Autumn...

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:41.960
<b>Matsutake Mushrooms</b>

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:41.950
Such a fragrant season.

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:44.420
Oh autumn, it's autumn!

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:46.300
It's a matsutake mushroom hunt!

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:47.790
I haven't had them in forever!

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:51.040
Guy Sensei and Kakashi Sensei
are both on cloud nine.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.980
Well, we're here to gather a 
bunch of matsutake mushrooms.

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:56.220
Hunt, hunt!

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:58.460
Cut 'em up!

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:00.840
What the heck?! Cut it out, Lee!

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.270
His spirit's in the right place,

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:04.470
but he's hunting the wrong game.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:08.690
Huh, what was...

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:21.140
<b>Hunting for Matsutake Mushrooms!</b>

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.120
There aren't any mushrooms!

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:27.140
Where did they all go?!

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:30.000
We came all this way to gather them...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.000
We had such an unusually hot summer,

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.560
they didn't grow so well.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:36.990
As you can see.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:41.220
This is the only one so far.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.600
<b>Full course</b>

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:43.970
<b>Time to eat</b>

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:44.470
<b>Nom Nom</b>

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:44.850
<b>Slurrrp</b>

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:45.260
<b>Blow, blow</b>

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:46.100
<b>Burp~</b>

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.100
Receipt Yamato 15,000

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:50.140
Even the matsutake mushroom dishes 
at the local restaurants...

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.310
<b>Grin</b>

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:50.170
<b>Full Course</b>

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:54.520
...have to get their supply 
from outside grocery stores.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:54.520
<b>Foreign Import</b>

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:56.270
We came all this way,

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:59.130
and there's nothing but 
junk from other villages...

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.240
Why does that make it junk?

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:05.820
Guess there won't be any new dishes
at the local Leaf Village restaurants.

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:08.220
We'll just have to head back.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:10.910
That's...

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:12.770
Hey, Neji.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:17.780
Lady Hinata!

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.360
Neji, Tenten...

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.260
What're you doing out here?

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.480
Wh-What a coincidence!

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:29.610
I'm just out here to landscape 
the mountainside.

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:31.150
That's some coincidence.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:35.730
A young girl cutting grass on a mountain
by herself in the 21st century...

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.570
What's wrong?

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:44.950
You were following us?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.060
Yes.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:50.160
I saw everyone leaving to 
look for matsutake mushrooms.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.920
I have the day off, too,

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.430
and you looked like you
were having so much fun.

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:57.510
Perhaps I shouldn't have,

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:00.030
but I ended up following your group.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.800
"Ended up"?

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:05.860
But you needn't have 
followed us in secret.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:07.900
You could've called 
out to us at any time.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.270
I, um...

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:14.400
Hinata wasn't following us, 
she was following Naruto!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.770
That's why you weren't 
more proactive, right?

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:21.110
Um... That's, well...

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:24.400
Gotcha. Let us help you out!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:27.280
It's up to you whether or not 
things work out with Naruto,

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:32.180
but maybe we can help you 
overcome your shyness?

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:33.570
Right, Neji?

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.790
If it'll help Hinata, I'm in.

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:41.800
Tenten... Neji...

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.110
Tenten, Neji, where were you?

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.160
Sorry, we had a thing to take care of.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.420
Ah, Hinata.

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:52.430
Oh, it's Hinata!

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.130
Whatcha doing way out here?

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.850
N-Naruto...

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.330
I-I-I...

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.710
Relax, relax!

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.380
Act natural.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.350
N-Natural...

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.440
I came to the mountain 
to do some laundry.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:08.860
What on earth is natural about that?!

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:11.400
I was trying to symbolize 
mother nature...

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:13.870
Wrong kind of acting and 
wrong kind of natural!

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.370
I see you're as subtle as ever.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.290
Subtle...

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:24.110
I-I knew it, I should've symbolized a big
natural monument like the Jomon Cedar!

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:25.350
At this point,

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:27.150
you're only symbolizing the 
loss of your rationality.

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:28.100
It's hopeless,

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.850
her brain doesn't function 
right around Naruto.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:33.850
Hey, whatever happened 
to the matsutake mushroom hunt?

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.300
We've all been talking,

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:38.690
and unfortunately it looks like 
we'll have to call it quits.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.530
Not a single one to be found anywhere.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:42.530
Maybe I'll go grab some ramen...

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.070
I think I'll head back 
and get some lunch, too...

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:48.030
Oh well...

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.390
<i>Oh no, no!</i>

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:51.370
<i>We just brought Hinata here!</i>

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:55.250
<i>If we don't do something as a group,
Hinata will never come out of her shell!</i>

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:58.710
Guy Sensei, hunting for matsutake 
mushrooms will be great training!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:01.920
We should keep up the hunt, 
no question about it!

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.580
<i>I really am craving them...</i>

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.170
<i>Going home without even eating one...</i>

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.240
G-Got it!

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:12.930
It's a competition to see who
can find the most mushrooms!

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:18.310
So the search for matsutake 
mushrooms begins, but...

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:22.730
Yeah, but if you ask me...

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.520
C'mon, Hinata, go up to Naruto.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:31.450
N-Naruto! Um, I―

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.320
Sakura!

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:35.620
It's a team competition! 
Let's work together!

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:39.850
He's not listening!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:45.050
We've got no choice but to gather
more matsutake mushrooms than them.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.480
If we win...

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.010
<b>Big Haul</b>

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.750
I never knew matsutake mushrooms were so good!

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.580
You're awesome, Hinata!

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:01.090
Oh yeah!

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:04.430
And that self-confidence will help 
her initiate the conversation!

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:06.530
Let's go for it, Lady Hinata!

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:08.990
Y-Yes!

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:11.630
Everyone's so motivated...

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.540
I'll have to do my absolute best!

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:14.450
So...

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.090
Let's roll!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.840
What is that outfit?!

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:37.240
I figured this would be the 
bare minimum for a hunt.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:39.480
You're just wasting time and energy!

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.940
And anyway, that's the 
wrong kind of hunt!

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:44.770
And why did you make
Hinata and me dress up, too?!

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:46.750
Then what about this?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.360
It's now 7 o'clock.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:52.350
Say hello to Kyouko.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:53.930
Wrong Hunters again!

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:56.480
I was trying to focus more 
on the confidence aspect.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:57.940
You're getting way too detailed now!

00:07:57.940 --> 00:07:59.400
And kids watching this show 
don't know the Hunters,

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.380
that's something from 
their mom's generation!

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:03.040
Fine then...

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.510
How about monster hunters?

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:08.660
The sponsors aren't 
paying enough for this!

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:09.880
That is...

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.960
...quite enough!

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:17.840
This being our first hunt,

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.330
I don't actually know the best strategy.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.520
Let's see what everyone else is doing.

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:28.770
Nothing.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:32.280
The matsutake mushrooms sure are shy.

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:46.090
Looks like Shikamaru's group is utilizing
Ino's Mind-Body Switch Jutsu.

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:50.790
Ah ha, Ino can invade the minds
of animals and control them.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.060
Mind...

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.330
That's it, the mind!

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:56.020
What is it?

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:59.720
In order to coax the matsutake
mushrooms to come out of hiding,

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.930
we need to get inside their heads!

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:05.310
Neji, Hinata, can you help me?

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.130
What about me?

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:08.830
You'd be useless.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:09.820
Useless...

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:13.030
I need Neji and Hinata for this job.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.860
M-Me?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:19.330
<b>What the?!</b>

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:20.870
Hey, hey, Matsuko.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:25.100
I'm going to a party with people
 from Mountain Yam U tomorrow!

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:27.680
Nameko and Donko are coming, too,

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.340
but we really need one more.

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:31.670
Hey, would you come?

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:36.650
Oh come on, Matsuko, quit being so shy!

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:39.860
If you came, you'd be the life
of the party, I just know it!

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:41.680
What are you even doing?!

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:46.930
I was trying to think like 
a shy matsutake mushroom,

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:50.860
and create an atmosphere where
they'd be comfortable showing up.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.250
If that was all it took,

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.790
every college in the country
would be full of mushrooms!

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.760
And why did we have to dress up again?!

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:01.950
Well, you, me and Hinata are the only
ones with mushroom-shaped heads―

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.370
Don't call us mushroom-heads!

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:05.580
Matsuko, you baby!

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:08.260
You...

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:11.570
You really want to go on the inside...

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:14.760
I can't stand it when girls are so hesitant!

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:19.390
I know because I'm shy, 
too, and I hate it!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.700
<i>Lady Hinata...</i>

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:23.720
<i>Hinata's talking about herself...</i>

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:26.390
I'm going to try my hardest.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.020
I'll try to be brave.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.630
And finally talk to Naruto...

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:31.440
Talk to me about what?

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.900
I figured I'd head back.
What're you all up to?

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:36.510
W-W-W―

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:40.470
Hinata!

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:41.190
Lady Hinata!

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:42.630
Naruto, you moron!

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:44.030
Huh?

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:49.000
I... don't... care anymore...

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.850
What an incredible tumble.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:53.980
It's like a metaphor for 
her life at this point!

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.500
Lady Hinata!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:05.430
Oh, that's...

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:07.640
Bon appétit!

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:10.990
Hinata ended up finding 
the only mushroom...

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:13.610
Even one is plenty delicious.

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.570
Great job, Hinata!

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.530
Naruto...

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:25.200
And so, the matsutake mushroom granted
Hinata a little more courage.

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:27.150
You know, Hinata,

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:29.300
I've been meaning to tell you something.

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:30.620
Yes?

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.910
Between your hairstyle 
and the way you act,

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:34.340
you remind me a lot of Bushy-Brows.

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:41.760
What's wrong?

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:44.830
Naruto...

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:45.970
Wh-What?!

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:55.840
Everyone gets angry sometimes, right?

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:00.360
I've had it up to here with this place!

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:05.410
Get me the money and safe passage
to another village, pronto!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:07.240
Someone help me!

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.830
Don't worry!

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:12.700
We're on the scene!
 You'll be safe!

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:15.830
Hey, that's the ninja who 
can't use ninjutsu, right?

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.290
How's he gonna save him?

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:21.770
I don't need ninjutsu to 
stop such a petty criminal.

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.680
With my genjutsu!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:26.260
Genjutsu? Oh no...

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:32.250
Come on, buddy, stop being unreasonable
and think of your poor mother back at home!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:33.230
I knew it.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:35.980
It's not too late.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:37.860
Don't make her suffer any more!

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:40.480
Miss, come talk to him.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.610
No way... Mom?

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:45.430
Why me, again...

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:50.580
Look at how depressed she is!

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:52.000
Whose fault is that?!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.750
It's your fault!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:07.390
<b>Lee and Neji Part Ways!</b>

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:11.360
Enough already!

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:15.070
Every single episode, you subject
me to the worst humiliations!

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:15.890
Neji...

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.020
Please, calm down.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.690
How can I calm down?!

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:21.080
On the matsutake mushroom hunt,

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.920
you made me dress up like 
a 70's singer, a dog,

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:26.780
and even a mushroom!

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:30.160
But that was Matsutake 
Matsuko's good friend

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.590
and fellow Toadstool College sophomore,

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:35.560
Shiitake Donko, not some 
random nameless mushroom.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:37.420
That's not the issue!

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.840
I'm done with this silliness!

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:42.560
Neji...

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.710
Wow, I never would've guessed.

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:48.760
Neji sounds pretty angry.

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:51.760
To be perfectly honest, 
this whole time...

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.640
I had no idea he felt that way.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.910
Really?!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:59.640
Every single skit you've ever done,

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:01.550
he's been in silly roles, weird costumes...

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:03.780
He's just been enduring it.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:07.420
I always thought he was on board.

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:12.120
If you'd only apply that kind of
optimism to more noble pursuits.

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:14.940
Next I'll keep him out 
the more colorful roles,

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:17.370
and cast him as the main character.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:18.830
You're not getting it!

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:22.450
Wouldn't it be better to just apologize?

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:25.880
Yeah, you're risking the
loss of a close friend.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.300
Perhaps...

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.520
I'll apologize to Neji...

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:32.330
And seal my genjutsu forever.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.260
They're skits.

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:35.960
Did you hear that, Kabuto?

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.230
Yes. Every word.

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:42.640
Lee's going to seal away 
his genjutsu techniques.

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:45.690
They're not genjutsu, they're 
skits, Lord Orochimaru.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:50.180
We've been defeated by those genjutsu
so many times, it's infuriating.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:53.130
You're starting to infuriate 
me, Lord Orochimaru.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.980
Lee without his genjutsu...

00:14:55.980 --> 00:15:01.580
...is nothing more than an old man
at a bar bragging about his glory days!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.040
That makes zero sense.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.510
This is gonna be good.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:08.950
<b>Hyuga</b>

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:08.970
Meanwhile, Neji is...

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:16.640
Jeez, I can't even stand to 
look at Lee right now.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:17.900
Neji...

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.220
Lady Hinata? What is it?

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:25.120
Um... Actually, I have 
a favor to ask of you.

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:26.360
Favor?

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.040
Yes.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:30.940
I want to stop being so 
introverted and shy,

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:33.030
and I'd like your help.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:35.360
Ah, is that all?

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:36.810
With pleasure.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:39.000
What would you like me to do?

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.960
I realized something during 
the matsutake mushroom hunt.

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:45.820
When I project myself 
onto something external,

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:48.340
I'm better able to say 
what's in my heart.

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:52.240
That day it was just a mushroom, but...

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:53.720
Uh-huh...

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:56.060
But if I use that as a starting point,

00:15:56.480 --> 00:16:00.020
I think I can learn to 
overcome my shyness!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.980
Again, what should I do?

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:04.470
Please...

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:07.710
Be my acting partner!

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:20.560
You need to apologize to Neji 
and bury the hatchet with him.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.490
Yeah, she's right.

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:25.430
Aw, you seem sad.

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:26.680
That voice!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:29.510
Orochimaru! What're you doing here?!

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:30.420
Oh?

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:33.080
Have you forgotten the 
motivations of my character?

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:35.680
I'm here to crush the Leaf, of course.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:40.020
<i>You've forgotten that more than anyone
in recent memory, Lord Orochimaru!</i>

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:41.770
You never learn.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:43.980
I won't let you harm the village!

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.330
Impressive confidence.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:49.440
But do you really think you can stop me?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.650
Absolutely.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.070
All right...

00:16:57.310 --> 00:16:59.120
Severe Leaf Hurricane!

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:08.040
What happened?!

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:10.680
How could Lord Orochimaru be 
sucked into that so easily?!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:12.520
Don't worry, Kabuto.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:20.760
Th-This is... genjutsu!

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:22.220
It's a skit.

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:25.850
If you really think you 
stand a chance, go ahead.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:29.730
But I know you're like a little
baby who hates his vegetables!

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.440
<i>Only one way out of this...</i>

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:42.440
<b>Salad Bar</b>

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:36.910
Gotta try and eat more fiber.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.410
That's the secret to a successful diet.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.370
No, no, no, no, no, no―

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:48.760
<i>But I've forsaken my genjutsu so
I can patch things up with Neji.</i>

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:50.590
<i>I can't fight back!</i>

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:51.970
<i>It worked!</i>

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:54.130
<i>Without his stupid skits,</i>

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:56.550
<i>Lee's lost his motivation to fight!</i>

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.730
<i>It's genjutsu!</i>

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:02.010
<i>Now I just have to deal 
the finishing blow!</i>

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:06.100
<i>Tenten, Neji, what do I do?</i>

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:09.530
You need me?

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:10.690
Yes.

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:13.400
Mayo, I need you by my side.

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:15.360
What're you talking about?

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:20.510
You and Saucestein of the sauces 
are inextricably linked.

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:26.870
Plus you've been with Bono the bonito
and Sean the seaweed forever.

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:27.980
But...

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:29.330
Konomi.

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.710
Please don't try to 
make me stray anymore.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:34.460
No!

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:39.210
I've always wanted to say this to you.

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:43.060
I never stopped thinking about you!

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:44.520
Konomi...

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:48.780
<i>The heck is this scene?</i>

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:50.320
<i>What are we, a soap opera?</i>

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:54.530
<i>And why is there drama between 
mayonnaise and okonomiyaki?</i>

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:59.830
<i>Even if it's for Hinata, 
the writing is so awful...</i>

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:02.150
That was wonderful, Neji.

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:02.700
Hmm?

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:06.570
I couldn't have made so much
progress if you weren't so good.

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:10.130
I'm just not used to this stuff...

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:11.670
I understand...

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:20.880
Someday I want to say that to the
actual person, not a bottle of mayo.

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:24.380
But thank you so much, Neji!

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:25.790
Lady Hinata...

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:30.730
I need to thank Lee and Tenten, as well.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:31.600
Those two?

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:37.520
Oh yes, I never would've been able to
ask this of you a couple years ago.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:42.570
Being with your friends has made
you so kind, and so dependable.

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:47.540
Can we do it once more?

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.500
Sorry, Lady Hinata.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.710
I just remembered something I have to do.

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:57.330
Then go ahead.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:02.380
Time to finish this.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.250
Lee!

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.260
What're you doing?!

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:12.060
You should've ended this 
genjutsu in a heartbeat!

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:13.800
Neji...

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:17.750
But I swore to shelve my genjutsu―

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:19.200
This isn't you.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:26.410
If it'll... help you... 
then I'll pitch in...

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:29.860
I've just... been thinking a little...

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:30.870
Neji...

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:33.040
Neji!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:36.340
A little! Just a little here and there!

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:39.340
Neji, Neji!

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:49.470
My eyes, it's in my eyes!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:50.420
Lord Orochimaru!

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:51.810
Mayo on veggies.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:54.430
Even a little baby like me 
will eat his veggies now!

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:57.210
Whatever, let's do this Lee!

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.090
Right!

00:20:58.090 --> 00:20:59.160
Let's go!

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:09.240
Neji...

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:10.560
Don't say anything.

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.350
I'm...

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.080
I'm sorry.

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:20.390
Neji!

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:25.770
And so, Neji showed Lee that he'd come
to understand his genjutsu a little.

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:30.660
Come on, buddy!

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:33.330
Think of your poor mother back at home!

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:36.290
Ma'am, come talk to him.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:42.030
Of course, he immediately regretted it.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.990
<i>I should've known...</i>

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:25.350
Next week is "We're 
Here to Welcome Gaara!"

00:23:22.720 --> 00:23:27.800
<b>We're Here to Welcome Gaara!
The Ultimate Autumn Diet!</b>

00:23:25.350 --> 00:23:27.800
and "The Ultimate Autumn Diet!"

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.090
Neji, let's keep up the 
momentum next episode!

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:32.710
Looks like I won't have to 
dress up at all next week.

00:23:32.710 --> 00:23:34.250
You couldn't be more wrong!

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:36.680
For certain conversations 
to be conveyed properly,

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:41.520
we need Nejie, Nejia, 
Nejiette, Nejitherine...

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:45.020
I've got about 800 characters 
lined up for you.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:47.820
Why do all of them have to be girls?!
